---
import Layout from '../../layouts/Layout.astro'
---

<Layout 
  title="Cosmology Cheat Sheet | Free Big Bang, Dark Matter, Dark Energy"
  description="Complete cosmology cheat sheet with Big Bang, dark matter, and dark energy. Free download for physics students."
>
  <section class="hero">
    <h1>Cosmology<br><span>Cheat Sheet</span></h1>
    <p>Big Bang, dark matter, and dark energy. From the origin of the universe to its fate.</p>
  </section>

  <section>
    <h2>Big Bang Model</h2>
    <div class="formula-grid">
      <div class="formula-card">
        <h3>Key Events</h3>
        <pre><code>t = 0: Big Bang (singularity)
t = 10⁻⁴³ s: Planck epoch
t = 10⁻³⁶ s: inflation
t = 3 min: nucleosynthesis
t = 380,000 yr: recombination (CMB)
t = 200 Myr: first stars
t = 13.8 Gyr: today</code></pre>
      </div>
      <div class="formula-card">
        <h3>Hubble's Law</h3>
        <pre><code>v = H₀d
v: recession velocity
d: distance
H₀ = 70 km/s/Mpc = 2.27 × 10⁻¹⁸ s⁻¹</code></pre>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section>
    <h2>Composition</h2>
    <div class="formula-grid">
      <div class="formula-card">
        <h3>Energy Budget</h3>
        <pre><code>Dark energy: 68%
Dark matter: 27%
Ordinary matter: 5%
Radiation: < 0.01%</code></pre>
      </div>
      <div class="formula-card">
        <h3>Dark Matter</h3>
        <pre><code>Does not emit/absorb light
Gravitational effects observed
Candidates: WIMPs, axions, MACHOs
Evidence: galaxy rotation curves, CMB, gravitational lensing</code></pre>
      </div>
      <div class="formula-card">
        <h3>Dark Energy</h3>
        <pre><code>Accelerating expansion
Cosmological constant Λ
Equation of state: w = -1
Energy density: ρ_Λ ≈ 5.96 × 10⁻²⁷ kg/m³</code></pre>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section>
    <h2>Cosmic Microwave Background</h2>
    <div class="formula-grid">
      <div class="formula-card">
        <h3>CMB Properties</h3>
        <pre><code>Temperature: 2.725 K
Blackbody spectrum
Anisotropies: ΔT/T ≈ 10⁻⁵
Provides evidence for Big Bang
Encodes information about early universe</code></pre>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section>
    <h2>Fate of the Universe</h2>
    <div class="formula-grid">
      <div class="formula-card">
        <h3>Possible Scenarios</h3>
        <pre><code>Big Freeze: dark energy dominates
Big Crunch: gravity reverses expansion
Big Rip: dark energy destroys everything
Big Bounce: cyclic model</code></pre>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section>
    <h2>Download</h2>
    <p>Print this page or save as PDF for quick reference.</p>
    <p><strong>Tip:</strong> Use Ctrl+P (Cmd+P on Mac) to print or save as PDF.</p>
  </section>
</Layout>
